flowchart TD
  T0[StartDataCollectTask] --> T1[Init peripherals]
  T1 --> T2[Loop delay 10ms]
  T2 --> T3[Update time regs]
  T3 --> T4[Read external ADC]
  T4 --> D1{Light flag}

  D1 -->|dark| B0[Back AD fixed 0 and set flag]
  B0 --> T2

  D1 -->|light| L0[Accumulate ref and trans, i++ and clear flag]
  L0 --> D2{i reach 20}
  D2 -->|no| T2
  D2 -->|yes| W0[Write regs and calc absorbance]
  W0 --> M1{Pool collect pending}
  M1 -->|yes| M2[Mutex and accumulate]
  M1 -->|no| M3[Skip]
  M2 --> C0[Clear sums, DAC, DataConv, OpenAbsorbLED]
  M3 --> C0
  C0 --> T2

  A0[ADS1220 ReadADCs] --> A1{Samples remaining}
  A1 -->|yes| A2[Wait DRDY, read, switch channel]
  A2 --> A1
  A1 -->|no| A3[Average and output]
  T4 --> A0
  A3 --> D1

  I0[ADC1 DMA TC ISR] --> I1[Pick DMA buffer]
  I1 --> I2[Sum 32 samples per channel]
  I2 --> I3[Average to InsideADCValue]
  I3 --> I4[Write temp and level AD regs]
